```css
body {
  font-size: 1.125rem;       /* ~18px at default settings */
  line-height: 1.6;          /* unitless */
}
.article { max-width: 65ch; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: 1rem; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.2; }
code, pre { font-size: 0.95em; }
.btn { padding: 0.5em 1em; min-height: 2.75rem; }  /* grows with its label */
```

| Choice | Why |
|---|---|
| ≥ 1rem body. | readable, respects user settings. |
| 45–75ch measure. | eyes find the next line easily. |
| unitless line-height. | spacing scales with text. |
| no fixed heights on text boxes. | longer translations and zoom don't overflow. |

